# Generated reports.
#
# These are machine-specific: they contain the host name, volume names, mount
# paths, and device identifiers of whatever Mac the tool last ran on. They are
# regenerable at any time with:
#
#     dotnet fsi MacDiskExplorer.fsx --all
#
# Latest, unstamped copies in the output directory:
disk-report.html
inventory.json
disks.csv
report.md

# Timestamped archive of previous runs (capped at 50 per report type):
history/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local agent/editor settings (machine-specific, not shared)
.claude/settings.local.json
